          "text": "A transaction must have a recognized EIP-2718 type byte, otherwise TransactionTypeError is raised."
        },
        {
          "id": "PRE-002",
          "text": "A transaction type must support contract creation if the transaction's 'to' field is empty, otherwise TransactionTypeContractCreationError is raised."
        }
      ],
